    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## C4 Auto Detail - Missed Call Lead Capture\n**Flow:** missed call -> is there already an active lead (Sheet row, same Business+Caller, Status New/Qualifying)? -> if not: text the caller, add ONE lead row, start a fresh conversation state.\n\n**Client-specific values:** only the 'Client Config' node. To reuse for another business, edit that node.\n\n**Sheet ('GroRank Missed Call' > 'Missed Call') headers, row 1:**\nTimestamp | Caller Number | Business Number | Name | Service | Vehicle | Preferred Day/Time | Status | Summary\n\n**Twilio:** Voice status callback -> this webhook (POST). Inbound SMS is handled by the SMS AI Agent workflow.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
